WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.169
And, we do begin this hour in

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:02.569
Ukraine.

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.904
With the mayor of Kyiv, now

00:00:03.904 --> 00:00:05.639
reporting explosion in the

00:00:05.639 --> 00:00:06.139
capital.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.307
, Said several people have been

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.142
injured in two separate

00:00:08.142 --> 00:00:08.642
districts.

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:09.743
And a two story building has

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:11.245
been hit by falling wreckage

00:00:11.245 --> 00:00:11.745
from a drone.

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:13.713
Now, this comes as Ukraine

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:14.414
accuses Russian forces of

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:15.448
trying to exhaust the country's

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.276
air defense system, Ukraine's

00:00:18.276 --> 00:00:19.076
military says Russia has been

00:00:19.445 --> 00:00:22.181
using a variety of missiles and

00:00:22.181 --> 00:00:22.681
air launch weapons against

00:00:22.681 --> 00:00:23.181
several regions, both in the

00:00:23.181 --> 00:00:24.082
north and the south.

00:00:24.082 --> 00:00:26.652
And, in suffragette region, one

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:29.388
Ukrainian official claims

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.601
Russian shoulders are dressing

00:00:30.601 --> 00:00:32.570
as civilians in an attempt to.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:33.771
Flee Russian and stalled

00:00:33.771 --> 00:00:34.838
authorities say they're moving

00:00:35.347 --> 00:00:36.816
hundreds of residents from the

00:00:36.816 --> 00:00:38.385
front lines in anticipation of

00:00:38.385 --> 00:00:39.186
Ukrainian counteroffensive.

00:00:39.552 --> 00:00:41.621
In the meantime, on the

00:00:42.121 --> 00:00:42.689
frontlines in the east, top

00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:43.856
commander say Russian forces

00:00:43.856 --> 00:00:45.458
are increasing their attack on

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:00.888
bakhmut.

00:01:00.888 --> 00:01:02.790
As the Ukrainian military

00:01:03.056 --> 00:01:03.824
remains determined to keep

00:01:04.324 --> 00:01:05.726
Russia from capturing the city

00:01:05.993 --> 00:01:08.796
by Tuesday, Moscow holds its

00:01:09.062 --> 00:01:09.863
World War II victory day

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:10.764
parade.

00:01:10.764 --> 00:01:11.965
Now, Ukraine says that Russia

00:01:12.332 --> 00:01:13.967
is doing everything possible to

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:16.336
take bakhmut, including sending

00:01:16.403 --> 00:01:17.037
in more forces.

00:01:17.738 --> 00:01:18.939
And, that includes Wagner

00:01:19.206 --> 00:01:20.908
fighters, just days ago the

00:01:21.175 --> 00:01:21.975
head of the Russian mercenary

00:01:22.743 --> 00:01:23.744
group had threatened to pull

00:01:24.011 --> 00:01:24.878
his men out of the fight

00:01:25.145 --> 00:01:25.846
because of a lack of

00:01:26.346 --> 00:01:26.747
ammunition.

00:01:26.747 --> 00:01:28.749
He now claims his fighters are

00:01:29.016 --> 00:01:29.917
advancing in bakhmut, as they

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:30.951
wait for more supplies.

00:01:31.218 --> 00:01:32.753
CNN's Sam kiley has our update

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:33.520
now from Kyiv.

00:01:35.389 --> 00:01:37.524
Fighting continues to be bloody

00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:39.460
and merciless in the east of

00:01:39.726 --> 00:01:40.627
the country, in particular

00:01:40.894 --> 00:01:42.529
around the city of bakhmut

00:01:42.796 --> 00:01:44.431
where the Ukrainians have

00:01:44.698 --> 00:01:45.632
suggested that it's possible

00:01:45.899 --> 00:01:47.434
that the Wagner group, or

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:49.536
elements supporting the Wagner

00:01:49.803 --> 00:01:51.405
group have been using

00:01:51.672 --> 00:01:52.439
incendiary devices and up

00:01:52.706 --> 00:01:53.106
battle.

00:01:53.106 --> 00:01:54.575
This coming as the leader of

00:01:54.842 --> 00:01:56.376
the mercenary organization has

00:01:56.643 --> 00:01:58.445
backtracked on his threat to

00:01:58.712 --> 00:01:59.580
leave the city and handover to

00:01:59.847 --> 00:02:00.581
check and fight.

00:02:00.848 --> 00:02:02.449
This is very much part of an

00:02:02.716 --> 00:02:04.651
ongoing soap opera effectively

00:02:04.918 --> 00:02:07.488
led by Mr. Prigozhin who has

00:02:07.754 --> 00:02:09.423
been tweeting and making public

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:10.757
statements since effectively

00:02:11.024 --> 00:02:11.758
the beginning of this.

00:02:12.025 --> 00:02:13.393
We're highly critical of the

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:14.061
Kremlin.

00:02:14.061 --> 00:02:15.395
And particularly the Russian

00:02:15.662 --> 00:02:16.162
military of defense.

00:02:16.396 --> 00:02:17.531
He now says that he is getting

00:02:17.798 --> 00:02:18.732
the ammunition that he needs so

00:02:19.399 --> 00:02:20.567
he won't be pulling his troops

00:02:20.834 --> 00:02:21.735
of for the foreseeable future.

00:02:22.402 --> 00:02:24.438
But, all eyes really are on

00:02:24.705 --> 00:02:26.440
where and when or even if the

00:02:26.707 --> 00:02:27.441
Ukrainians are going to be

00:02:27.708 --> 00:02:28.775
launching a summer offensive.

00:02:29.409 --> 00:02:30.544
There have been massive troop

00:02:30.811 --> 00:02:31.712
movements, a lot of talk from

00:02:32.446 --> 00:02:33.447
the Ukrainians about an

00:02:33.714 --> 00:02:35.516
offensive but no real sounds

00:02:35.782 --> 00:02:37.618
yet on the ground that anything

00:02:37.885 --> 00:02:38.819
is, especially, imminent.

00:02:39.386 --> 00:02:40.420
Sam kiley, CNN, in Kyiv.

00:02:43.757 --> 00:02:45.025
Joining me now from Washington,

00:02:45.292 --> 00:02:46.927
retired U.S. Air force colonel

00:02:47.194 --> 00:02:48.829
and CNN military analyst

00:02:49.096 --> 00:02:49.930
frederik Layton.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:51.031
Good to have you weigh in on

00:02:51.298 --> 00:02:52.966
these issues, we've had quite a

00:02:53.233 --> 00:02:54.935
few days, though the Wagner

00:02:55.202 --> 00:02:56.803
group leader, he made those

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.805
dramatic threats to pull out of

00:02:59.072 --> 00:03:00.007
bakhmut, turned out it was

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.909
quite a performance, right?

00:03:02.442 --> 00:03:03.744
It looks like his troops are

00:03:04.011 --> 00:03:04.511
staying put.

00:03:04.745 --> 00:03:05.979
Now, does this incident give

00:03:06.446 --> 00:03:07.881
you any insight into what is

00:03:08.448 --> 00:03:09.883
going on with either the Wagner

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.819
group or the Russian military?

00:03:13.086 --> 00:03:15.789
&gt;&gt; Well, Paula I think that it

00:03:16.056 --> 00:03:17.758
is kind of the battle of the

00:03:18.025 --> 00:03:18.992
tantrums, if you will, and in

00:03:19.259 --> 00:03:22.796
this particular case prigozhin

00:03:23.063 --> 00:03:23.997
'S tantrum has seemed to one

00:03:24.464 --> 00:03:24.798
day for him.

00:03:24.798 --> 00:03:26.767
Another word, to get dig have

00:03:27.034 --> 00:03:28.802
weapons and ammunition's, gets

00:03:29.069 --> 00:03:29.970
a resupply line for his troops

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:32.773
in bakhmut that didn't appear

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.008
to have that good of a resupply

00:03:35.275 --> 00:03:35.775
line.

00:03:35.842 --> 00:03:37.811
And he gets to stay in that

00:03:38.078 --> 00:03:38.946
horrible meat grinder.

00:03:39.212 --> 00:03:41.915
So in some ways it might be

00:03:42.482 --> 00:03:43.784
considered a victory for

00:03:44.051 --> 00:03:44.484
prigozhin.

00:03:44.484 --> 00:03:46.019
But in other ways it is a --

00:03:46.787 --> 00:03:48.121
story because staying in that

00:03:48.488 --> 00:03:49.790
meat grinder, it doesn't do

00:03:50.057 --> 00:03:50.557
anybody any favors.

00:03:50.924 --> 00:03:53.093
&gt;&gt; Yes, and when I say that

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.795
it's a performance, you know,

00:03:55.062 --> 00:03:56.763
I'm not trying to be trite, it

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:58.765
seems that it was a message to

00:03:59.032 --> 00:04:00.067
someone and yet if you think

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.802
all he wanted from that was

00:04:02.069 --> 00:04:03.036
ammunition, while that would be

00:04:03.303 --> 00:04:04.071
pretty naive to think that.

00:04:04.504 --> 00:04:06.840
It was clearly some type of

00:04:07.107 --> 00:04:07.607
propaganda per.

00:04:07.641 --> 00:04:08.942
&gt;&gt; Absolutely, well there's

00:04:09.209 --> 00:04:10.043
propaganda and there's a power

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:11.011
struggle going on Paula.

00:04:11.745 --> 00:04:13.113
And, what that basically means,

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.849
to me, is that prigozhin, let

00:04:16.116 --> 00:04:18.852
it be known that he has a

00:04:19.753 --> 00:04:20.921
military element that could be

00:04:21.188 --> 00:04:22.990
withdrawn and could potentially

00:04:23.256 --> 00:04:25.192
put at risk Russia's frontline.

00:04:25.792 --> 00:04:27.794
And if that frontline had

00:04:28.061 --> 00:04:29.896
collapsed, that would've been a

00:04:30.163 --> 00:04:30.931
calamity towards the Russian

00:04:31.198 --> 00:04:31.698
forces.

00:04:31.765 --> 00:04:33.767
So what prigozhin is doing is

00:04:34.034 --> 00:04:35.068
that he is flexing his muscles

00:04:35.335 --> 00:04:37.871
in a way that he is in a

00:04:38.138 --> 00:04:39.773
position to where he can, in

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.942
essence complain and make sure

00:04:42.209 --> 00:04:44.077
that he gets what he wants in

00:04:44.544 --> 00:04:45.078
this particular case.

00:04:45.846 --> 00:04:49.950
But he is basically asking for

00:04:50.217 --> 00:04:51.018
us much power as he can get.

00:04:51.284 --> 00:04:51.985
&gt;&gt; Right.

00:04:52.753 --> 00:04:54.021
And that turned our attention

00:04:54.554 --> 00:04:55.756
now to Ukraine's

00:04:56.023 --> 00:04:57.057
counteroffensive, it could

00:04:57.324 --> 00:04:58.158
start as early as this week.

00:04:58.859 --> 00:05:00.060
Do you think expectations are

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:01.060
too high at this point?

00:05:01.261 --> 00:05:02.796
Especially if what Ukraine is

00:05:03.063 --> 00:05:04.898
looking for is a decisive blow

00:05:05.165 --> 00:05:07.100
to the Russian military in this

00:05:07.367 --> 00:05:07.834
war?

00:05:07.834 --> 00:05:09.870
&gt;&gt; Yes, if you're going to

00:05:10.137 --> 00:05:11.772
mount a decisive blow on an

00:05:12.039 --> 00:05:12.806
operation like this, or at a

00:05:13.073 --> 00:05:14.875
conflict like this, there's got

00:05:15.142 --> 00:05:16.043
to be an element of surprise

00:05:16.576 --> 00:05:16.877
here.

00:05:16.877 --> 00:05:19.012
And right now, it seems to me

00:05:19.279 --> 00:05:24.785
at least, that we have

00:05:25.052 --> 00:05:26.820
telegraphed way too much --

00:05:27.087 --> 00:05:29.189
that this offensive is going to

00:05:29.456 --> 00:05:29.856
happen.

00:05:29.856 --> 00:05:31.958
And the only thing that is on

00:05:32.225 --> 00:05:34.027
the specific details is the

00:05:34.594 --> 00:05:35.094
time in place.

00:05:35.195 --> 00:05:35.896
But we believe that it's going

00:05:36.163 --> 00:05:36.863
to happen this week.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.799
We believe that it's going to

00:05:39.066 --> 00:05:40.167
happen, probably, in the south.

00:05:40.834 --> 00:05:42.102
And then we believe that it's

00:05:42.602 --> 00:05:43.970
going to affect the approaches

00:05:44.237 --> 00:05:44.737
to crimea.

00:05:44.838 --> 00:05:47.774
So that is a major area that

00:05:48.041 --> 00:05:48.975
shouldn't be a big surprise to

00:05:49.242 --> 00:05:49.943
the Russians.

00:05:50.744 --> 00:05:52.779
But if the Ukrainians have

00:05:53.046 --> 00:05:55.816
ability warfare and combined

00:05:56.083 --> 00:05:56.850
force operations, putting all

00:05:57.117 --> 00:05:58.752
the elements with the military

00:05:59.019 --> 00:06:00.120
force together in a coordinated

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:02.789
fashion, then they could still

00:06:03.056 --> 00:06:03.990
achieve some successes.

00:06:04.257 --> 00:06:04.991
But it won't be as dramatic as

00:06:05.258 --> 00:06:06.927
there would've been if they had

00:06:07.194 --> 00:06:07.928
the ultimate surprise.

00:06:08.195 --> 00:06:08.995
&gt;&gt; Yes, such a good point.

00:06:09.262 --> 00:06:10.130
We've been talking about this

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.198
for months of things now.

00:06:11.832 --> 00:06:12.999
And I have to ask you,

00:06:13.266 --> 00:06:14.768
strategically, the U.S., the

00:06:15.035 --> 00:06:15.769
allies that they've given

00:06:16.036 --> 00:06:17.003
Ukraine enough capability at

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:17.770
this point?

00:06:17.804 --> 00:06:19.072
And has it arrived in time?

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:22.909
&gt;&gt; Well it, is mixed, the

00:06:23.176 --> 00:06:24.811
verdict on that is definitely

00:06:25.078 --> 00:06:25.578
mixed.

00:06:25.812 --> 00:06:26.780
I think that some of the

00:06:27.047 --> 00:06:27.748
capabilities such as the

00:06:28.014 --> 00:06:29.883
patriot missile system which

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.119
reportedly has shot down for a

00:06:32.652 --> 00:06:33.820
hypersonic missiles that is a

00:06:34.087 --> 00:06:36.022
major plus for the Ukrainians.

00:06:36.757 --> 00:06:38.992
However their polling to be two

00:06:39.259 --> 00:06:40.827
victory batteries in Ukraine

00:06:41.094 --> 00:06:42.028
and they will need far more

00:06:42.295 --> 00:06:43.997
than that in order to mountain

00:06:44.264 --> 00:06:44.965
effective air defense and

00:06:45.232 --> 00:06:46.867
missile defense for the

00:06:47.134 --> 00:06:47.634
country.

00:06:47.834 --> 00:06:49.803
And, the other thing that of

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:51.972
course is missing, is required

00:06:52.239 --> 00:06:52.906
quantity of tanks.

00:06:53.173 --> 00:06:53.974
And, of course, aircraft.

00:06:54.241 --> 00:06:56.877
The Ukrainians want the f-16.

00:06:57.144 --> 00:06:58.745
They're not getting the f-16

00:06:59.012 --> 00:06:59.980
until after all of this is done,

00:07:00.747 --> 00:07:01.181
if at all.

00:07:01.181 --> 00:07:02.816
And, that of course will

00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:05.786
provide them with a significant

00:07:06.052 --> 00:07:07.921
lack of capability, at this

00:07:08.188 --> 00:07:09.122
particular point and that could

00:07:09.389 --> 00:07:10.957
have a significant impact on

00:07:11.224 --> 00:07:12.125
their ability to perform.

00:07:12.759 --> 00:07:14.027
&gt;&gt; Yes, it will be interesting

00:07:14.294 --> 00:07:14.995
to see what the blowback is

00:07:15.262 --> 00:07:16.797
from Ukraine, if and when that

00:07:17.063 --> 00:07:17.464
happens.

00:07:17.464 --> 00:07:18.799
Again, some pivotal months

00:07:19.065 --> 00:07:19.565
ahead, for sure.

